00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:10,673
Politico Europe reports that France’s domestic intelligence chief warned of more violent hostile actions as hybrid warfare grows across Europe.

2
00:00:10,623 --> 00:00:17,829
She cited the discovery of an explosive drone near a Ukrainian cargo plane at Leipzig Airport.

3
00:00:17,829 --> 00:00:27,697
Officials have not assigned blame, but France says foreign interference and disinformation have increased sharply since 2022.

